TITLE:: ProbeBroker
summary:: Centralized measurement broker and subscription manager
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeLevelsSource, Classes/ProbeSpectrumSource, Classes/ProbeLoudnessSource, Classes/ProbeVectorscopeSource

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeBroker acts as the central coordinator between audio-server analysis synths and graphical presentation widgets. It keys sources by server, measurement type, bus index, channel count, and update frequency.

When multiple visualizer windows (e.g. two meters or a dashboard) monitor the same bus, the broker shares a single analysis Synth and OSC responder rather than duplicating audio thread load.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: default
Returns the default singleton broker.

METHOD:: new
Creates a new broker instance.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: subscribeLevels
Subscribes a consumer object to a peak and RMS level measurement source.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
An identifying object (e.g. view or symbol).

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busType
code::\outputs::, code::\inputs::, or code::\bus::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of audio channels.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Telemetry update frequency in Hz.

ARGUMENT:: onDataCallback
Function evaluated on AppClock when new measurement values arrive: code::{ |peaks, rms, peakHold, source| ... }::.

METHOD:: subscribeSpectrum
Subscribes to a shared logarithmic spectral band analysis source.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
Consumer object.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numBands
Number of logarithmic filter bands (default 64).

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update frequency in Hz.

ARGUMENT:: onDataCallback
Function evaluated with new band array data.

METHOD:: subscribeLoudness
Subscribes to an ITU-R BS.1770-4 / EBU R128 loudness telemetry source.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
Consumer object.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busType
code::\outputs::, code::\inputs::, or code::\bus::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus offset.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels (1 or 2).

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update rate in Hz.

ARGUMENT:: onDataCallback
Function evaluated with code::{ |m, s, i, lra, maxPeak, source| ... }::.

METHOD:: subscribeCorrelation
Subscribes to a stereo correlation and balance measurement source.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
Consumer object.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update rate in Hz.

ARGUMENT:: onDataCallback
Function evaluated with code::{ |corr, bal, source| ... }::.

METHOD:: subscribeSpectral
Subscribes to a shared multi-descriptor spectral analysis source.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
Consumer object.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update rate in Hz.

ARGUMENT:: onDataCallback
Function evaluated with dictionary of spectral descriptors, pitch, chroma, and bands.

METHOD:: unsubscribe
Unsubscribes a consumer from a specific source key. If no consumers remain, the source is automatically stopped and freed.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
Consumer object.

ARGUMENT:: sourceKey
Symbolic source key.

METHOD:: unsubscribeAll
Unsubscribes a consumer from all active sources.

ARGUMENT:: consumer
Consumer object to release.

METHOD:: sourceCount
Returns the number of active sources.

METHOD:: totalSubscriberCount
Returns the total number of active subscriptions across all sources.

METHOD:: freeAll
Frees all active sources and clears all subscriptions.
